    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Rebellion Era Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species_Feats\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Species Feats\">Species Feats</a></i></p><p>You have intimate knowledge of the workings of Starships and other Vehicles and can keep them running no matter what.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mon_Calamari\" title=\"Mon Calamari\">Mon Calamari</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b>&nbsp;You need spend only two <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Actions\" title=\"Swift Actions\">Swift Actions</a> to move a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vehicle\">Vehicle</a> you occupy +1 step on the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a>. In addition, you automatically succeed on Mechanics checks to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reroute_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reroute Power\">Reroute Power</a>.</p><p><b>Normal:</b> It takes three <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Actions\" title=\"Swift Actions\">Swift Actions</a> to use the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reroute_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reroute Power\">Reroute Power</a> Action.</p>",
